From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rosemary port <port@local>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:26:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] iokit: add IORPC.kernelContent so Xcode 16 iig builds

The macOS 14 runner image is retired on 2026-11-02, so the build has to move
to macos-15 and its Xcode 16 toolchain. Xcode 16's iig emits kernel-side
DriverKit RPC code that assigns rpc.kernelContent, which xnu-8796's IORPC
struct does not have. Upstream xnu-11215 (macOS 15) carries exactly this
member, so backport the field (kernel builds only, like upstream).
---
diff --git a/iokit/IOKit/IORPC.h b/iokit/IOKit/IORPC.h
--- a/iokit/IOKit/IORPC.h
+++ b/iokit/IOKit/IORPC.h
@@ -224,6 +224,11 @@
 	IORPCMessageMach * reply;
 	uint32_t           sendSize;
 	uint32_t           replySize;
+#ifdef KERNEL
+	/* Xcode 16's iig (macOS 15 SDK) assigns rpc.kernelContent on the kernel
+	 * side of DriverKit RPC; macOS 15 xnu gained the same member (11215). */
+	IORPCMessage     * kernelContent;
+#endif /* KERNEL */
 };
 typedef struct IORPC IORPC;
 

